Firmware
--------
* (ASUS LAPTOP)
  Disable fast boot in BIOS.

* fwupd-efi: remove the delay from an obsolete firmware-update boot entry.
  Inspect entries with sudo efibootmgr first, then delete only the identified entry:
  sudo efibootmgr --delete-bootnum --bootnum <entry-number>

