Tailscale
---------
- Log in once: sudo tailscale up (open the link it prints).
- Serve the signalbox web UI on the tailnet: sbn share. The first time, it prints a
  link to enable serve and HTTPS for the tailnet; open it, then run sbn share again.
  It prints this machine's address; sbn unshare removes the routes.
- Phone: install the Tailscale app, log in with the same account, open the address in
  Safari, and Share > Add to Home Screen.
- Nothing about the tailnet belongs in this repository: its name, addresses and keys
  stay in /var/lib/tailscale.
